<title>JAPAN: JGBs slightly higher,supported by cash bond buying.</title>
<headline>JGBs slightly higher,supported by cash bond buying.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key September 10-year JGB futures ended Tokyo slightly higher, supported by buying of long-term cash bonds in the afternoon.</p>
<p>*IBJ's June five-year bank debentures were traded at 1.94 percent compared to Wednesday's close of 1.98 percent.</p>
</text>
